* Binary archive SHA-256:
  9c538924110a7cdef871ca36dee218c0774124374ffdeb38af4b76be55bdf7c2
* Signed annotated source tag: v3.0.2
* Source commit: 6b20f622a77b87b2921fe5d2c1774d2f2ba3e9b7
* Source: https://github.com/doitsujin/dxvk/tree/v3.0.2
